{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released plugin ordering contract.** Existing configurations document hooks as running in registration order, while this reverses every invocation-end hook. After a patch upgrade, plugins may observe another plugin\u2019s MDC, tracing scope, or shared resource already torn down. Keep registration order, or add an explicit/versioned opt-in for LIFO cleanup with compatibility coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77ywC5","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"ddb3379e1d6aae712ad7e3c09b2889a5c71abbc4de9d9ab9ba698ac03b53c3ab","observation_id":"aro_v1_3wztphq5nkxhckwx4pajwkejux","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:36:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hjnslaecoawhogmflcr6ssjxbu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"007031a9b825543c1e1bae2b412df2f3d2159461","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_cu4k5ub3npbichewpyesrioyml","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:36:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
